;
; key_gold.tres — ItemDefinition for the gold chest key.
; Found in: underwater-temple and dungeon loot only (03-CONTEXT.md D-04).
; Consumed on first-use UNLOCK of a gold chest (Pitfall 6 — validated by Inventory autoload).
